<title>UK: Frankfurter Hypo prices 500 mln marks 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>Frankfurter Hypo prices 500 mln marks 2004 bond.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, April 11 Reuter) - The following fungible bond has been priced, joint lead managers Caisse des Depots et Consignations, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Dresdner Bank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FRANKFURTER HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.00	MATURITY    16.JAN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.68     PAY DATE    18.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    97.49     SPREAD	+9 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	TOTAL SIZE IS NOW 2.0 BLN DEM</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.00 PCT TREUHAND DUE 2003</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
